GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w: PHP maintainers' fix series for the memory_limit bailout
("interrupted operation") class: a soft and a hard memory limit with delayed OOM
reporting, reset of the (un)serialize contexts and of the session globals before
RINIT, incomplete-class-only (un)serialization in the upload-progress hook, and
post_max_size enforcement while a multipart body is buffered.
